{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0093-s001", "text": "När dina personuppgifter registreras sparas samtidigt också en adress för dig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075620348016+0000-5/hb-c12-u0093-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.296051025390625, "generation_seconds": 25.681202942039818, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0093-s002", "text": "Adressen kan vara tillfällig, permanent eller enbart postadress.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075620348016+0000-5/hb-c12-u0093-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.3409423828125, "generation_seconds": 19.495434218086302, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0094-s001", "text": "En tillfällig adress gäller tillfälligt och du har blivit registrerad som invånare på adressen för en viss tidsperiod.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075620348016+0000-5/hb-c12-u0094-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.309659863945578, "peak": 0.339996337890625, "generation_seconds": 29.485735507914796, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0094-s002", "text": "En tillfällig adress gäller vanligtvis ett år i taget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075620348016+0000-5/hb-c12-u0094-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.9458503401360545, "peak": 0.26458740234375, "generation_seconds": 13.932858233107254, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0095-s001", "text": "När Myndigheten för digitalisering och befolkningsdata registrerar dig en permanent adress, registrerar den dig som invånare på adressen tills vidare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075620348016+0000-5/hb-c12-u0095-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.096054421768708, "peak": 0.266021728515625, "generation_seconds": 34.75152501091361, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0095-s002", "text": "Adressen gäller tills du gör en flyttanmälan till en annan adress.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075620348016+0000-5/hb-c12-u0095-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.325653076171875, "generation_seconds": 18.67009192192927, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0095-s003", "text": "Samtidigt sparas för dig även en hemkommun i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075620348016+0000-5/hb-c12-u0095-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.9458503401360545, "peak": 0.331268310546875, "generation_seconds": 19.186911740107462, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0095-s004", "text": "Hemkommunen kan vara en stor stad eller en liten kommun.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-personuppgifter/narration/resume-20261103T075620348016+0000-5/hb-c12-u0095-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.9458503401360545, "peak": 0.310638427734375, "generation_seconds": 22.820182727184147, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
